Description: EPUB reader for The Lunduke Computer Operating System
 Read-O-Matic is a single-window gtkmm-3 EPUB reader in the WinHelp 4 /
 OS/2 VIEW.EXE shape. Local EPUB files only, one LCOS-flavoured skin,
 no browser engine.
